rn tower, one floor down.</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px;\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Thomas\">Thomas</a></td><td class=\"npc-animation\" style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center; line-height: 64px;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Thomas\"><img alt=\"Thomas\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Thomas_19791a.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></td><td style=\"width: 110px; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Shopkeeper%20NPCs\">Shopkeeper</a></td><td style=\"width: 72px; text-align: center;\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></td><td style=\"\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Edron\">Edron</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Noodles%20Academy%20of%20Modern%20Magic\">Ivory Towers</a> three floors up in the western tower</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px;\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Ursula\">Ursula</a></td><td class=\"npc-animation\" style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center; line-height: 64px;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Ursula\"><img alt=\"Ursula\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Ursula_acaf33.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></td><td style=\"width: 110px; text-align: center;\">Paladin Guild Leader</td><td style=\"width: 72px; text-align: center;\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></td><td style=\"\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Edron\">Edron</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Noodles%20Academy%20of%20Modern%20Magic\">Ivory Towers</a>, southern tower</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px;\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Wyrdin\">Wyrdin</a></td><td class=\"npc-animation\" style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center; line-height: 64px;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Wyrdin\"><img alt=\"Wyrdin\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Wyrdin_7262ae.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></td><td style=\"width: 110px; text-align: center;\">Mage</td><td style=\"width: 72px; text-align: center;